The decision is AVOID at conviction 3, the same verdict as on 2026-11-08. Three things to know:
- **No entry price.** The entry price is null because a lower price can't reach conviction 4: full valuation points still leave the score short of the buy line.
- **Debt trigger is text-only.** The site's debt/EBITDA figure is already 1.29, so the net-debt trigger can't use an automatic check; the weekly reviewer has to test it by hand.
- **Ex-dividend date not checked.** The note says part of the fall may come from a dividend going ex, but it did not confirm the ex-date.
